A simple example that retrieves a property label by its ID:

```ts
const propertyLabel =
  await settingsModuleService.retrievePropertyLabel("prlbl_123")
```

To specify the fields to retrieve:

```ts
const propertyLabel =
  await settingsModuleService.retrievePropertyLabel("prlbl_123", {
    select: ["id", "entity", "property", "label"],
  })
```
